cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it together with the FINN model paper(s) for the version you used, and acknowledge the FINN data archive (NSF NCAR RDA ds312.9) and the IBGE municipality boundaries."
title: "FINN_SC: biomass-burning emissions of Santa Catarina, Brazil (FINN, 2003-2025)"
abstract: "Code, data and documentation that reproduce the tables, statistics and figures of the article on the spatio-temporal variability of biomass-burning emissions in Santa Catarina, Brazil (2012-2025), and of the 2025 state inventory report of biomass-burning emissions, from the Fire INventory from NCAR (FINN). Route B recomputes every published result from the archived FINN records of Santa Catarina (2003-2025) and the archived external data (MapBiomas, MCD64A1, ERA5-Land, ONI, IBGE); route A downloads, unit-converts, clips, aggregates and maps FINN emissions for any region, in R and in Python."
authors:
